{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_08_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_08","title":"願跟隨主","storyCode":"HE-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"01a862540250cf06aac24197e27d09c3a72d92377d2795be6ff86bd3447b0337","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"費德里科會為所有待辦事項分出優先順序，現在最優先的，並非緝捕眼前的阿爾圖羅。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g12_anbandonspace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都已經準備好了，眾人會在晨會上吃下它......吃下最後一頓餐食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的琴聲......會為我感到悲哀嗎？還是慶賀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂音樂，阿爾圖羅。就像我無法理解你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站在這裡，我與你共感，但你彷彿一片空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是依照我的意願自由演奏，閣下。我的音樂只是一面鏡子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏡子......呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年邁的主教端起瓷盤，雙手在琴聲中顫抖著。\n他彷彿在與幽暗中迴盪的琴音角力，等待著對方的終結。\n多年前修道院裡響起樂聲時，他還很年輕，年輕到在噴泉裡的倒影中看不見一根白髮。\n荒野的羽獸被吸引到這片移動的沃土上，在管風琴聲中振翅，飛過廣場。年邁的老主教將修道院交給他，最年輕的修士斯特凡諾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你要留眾人活在樂園之中。”\n我要如何留眾人活在樂園之中？\n如今歷經滄桑的主教托雷格羅薩閉上眼睛。\n琴音依然迴盪著，迴盪著，迴盪著。然後——\n他鬆開了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多痛苦啊，這就是你的選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"禮拜堂緊閉的大門裡傳來模糊的說話聲。\n費德里科站在空曠的大廳中聽了片刻，然後轉身走上了樓梯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......裝備正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"截至目前，唯一的損失為一枚通訊器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當前目標未更改，繼續執行任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已鎖定嫌疑人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖餐儀式應該已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情況和我想的一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，費德里科呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯絡不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他知不知道深海教會養出來的怪物有多難對付？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作總是需要人來做。蕾繆安和斯普莉雅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到你的消息之後，她們去地下調查了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那這最麻煩的工作只能我們兩個人來幹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推門吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論身在何處，無論面對何種境遇，我們都應當彼此尊敬，彼此愛護——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——早安，來自聖城的使者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......盤子已經空了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊，控制住全部居民。我來對付主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼疑問嗎，使者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疑問？倒不如說......閣下為何想不開，非要將這次晨會變成“最後一次”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安應該告知過閣下，回到拉特蘭對接之後，閣下有很大機會繼續擔任這座修道院的主教......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的使者，你們......憑什麼來質問我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已做出自己的選擇，放棄了所有人都能得救的宏願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修道院已經窮途末路，最後一次晨會上，就讓所有人的盤子空著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛向眾人宣佈，安布羅修修道院，同意返回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......返回拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下該不會認為，我們會放任深海教會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我說過了，我已做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，他說的是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居民們並沒有產生變化的跡象。我檢查過餐盤了，是乾淨的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我親手處理了那些怪物的血肉，全部摻進了麵包裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這批原本用於晨會的麵包，我已經鎖在了地下的櫃子裡，以免饑餓的居民誤食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今奧盧斯已經離開，你們擔憂的東西不會繼續滋生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是櫃門的鑰匙，請你們拿去。這可以證明我所言非虛，你們或許也更清楚如何處置深海教會的贈予。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來今天用不上這把銃了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會覺得遺憾吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是鬆了口氣，麻煩的事情終於結束了。接下來的工作該回到正軌了......吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蕾繆安，你聽到主教說的話了嗎？我這就帶著鑰匙下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":true,"text":"櫃子被人砸穿了，裡面是空的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g12_anbandonspace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"褪色餐巾，地上的瓷盤碎片，其他細節全都和主教的陳述一致呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，從之前的記載來看，吃下這些東西的後果是不可逆的......他如果真的已經讓人吃下了這些，就沒有必要再對我們說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就說明有人偷走了這份“聖餐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須立刻找到這個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，在這麼大的修道院裡找人，是不是有點太困難了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，我們好像都忘記了一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，杰拉爾德聽說了那個薩科塔女孩墮天，這件事給了他很大打擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們絕不可能把墮天的消息傳出去，杰拉爾德是如何得知了這件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再比如，聖堂的那場火，究竟是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有其他人的支持，主教或許也不會如此一意孤行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這一切之後，恐怕失望的人不止主教一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我記得，福爾圖娜走進禮拜堂時，在場的還有一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教閣下還是做了這樣的選擇......\n我也不是沒有想過，最後事情很可能會變成現在這樣。\n主教閣下是個善良的人，這份善良令他懷抱著崇高的理想努力到現在，也使得他在最後一刻敗給了軟弱。\n而我與他不同。\n在很久很久以前，我就已經不再懷抱希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔？有客人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說，我有些驚訝。雖說給了你提示，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為根據你的那套理性邏輯判斷，你會得出“有其他優先順序更高的事項要處理”這種結論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們有多久沒見過面了，費德里科？五年，還是六年？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎麼你不說——“停止這些沒有意義的言語，通緝犯阿爾圖羅”了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，這次你終於打算換一種打招呼的方式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不如就像住在我家裡的那些年一樣......叫我一聲姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哦？到了這個地步都沒有生氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你走進這扇門，竟然沒有在看到我的第一時刻動手，這不是你的風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我來猜猜你現在反常的原因好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是在等待什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是說......你在猶豫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你聽，這座小小的修道院裝滿了各種各樣的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"悲傷，痛苦，猜疑，嫉恨......還有絕望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有的聲音交織在一起，比任何人為創造出來的旋律都要細膩動人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真是好奇。費德里科·吉亞洛，你感受到什麼了嗎？到底有沒有哪一種音符，能在你那不同於常人的大腦中躍動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"通緝犯阿爾圖羅，我已對你的言語與行動完成評估。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目前我要優先處理的事項不是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有去禮拜堂嗎，費德里科先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你和你的同事們的視線都會被主教閣下吸引......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是主導這一系列異常事件的嫌疑人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重......是的，我尊重主教閣下的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都尊敬他、愛戴他，當然會這樣，因為我們都在主教閣下的庇護之下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很好理解，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你出於各種原因被城市驅逐，只能徘徊在荒野上，認定自己只有死路一條的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你饑腸轆轆，不管朝什麼方向走，都只能看到單調絕望的景色，好像永遠走不出這片吃人之地的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這時候，你跨過一個小坡，越過一塊岩石，穿過一條峽谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到塵土的後方，竟然有一座城一樣的建築，裡面的人給你端來食物，還讓你留在屋子裡過夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管只有一點點粗糙的麵包，一碗味道很淡的湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管屋子的牆壁有裂縫，總需要修修補補......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你沒有在荒野上死去。你被接納了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們有些人會稱這裡為“樂園”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“樂園”......然而是虛假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在來到這裡不久之後，我發現......身邊有感染了礦石病的薩卡茲朋友消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找了她很久，才發現......就在這裡，在地下有一間房間，聽說從前是個訓練室，那裡的牆壁很結實......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們會把病得快要不行了的人送去那個房間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......非專業的防護設備並不能真正有效地阻斷源石粉塵傳播。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有別的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你想說那些得了病的人，可以自覺地在生命的最後時刻離開修道院，獨自去荒野上等待死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能做的只有把這些痛苦埋藏在看不見的地方，別過頭去，掩住耳朵......我們從來救不了誰，也沒有誰能救我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可即便是這樣虛假的平靜，也終究會被打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在，你們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務是維繫這裡的秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這裡的生活並不是被你們摧毀的。它只是自然而然地變成了現在的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我種的花，無論我再怎麼精心呵護它，到了它該凋謝的時候，它還是會一點點地變得面目全非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被阿爾圖羅影響了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說阿爾圖羅小姐的琴聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。從她的琴聲裡，我常常能聽見上面這些回憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她從來沒有走進我們的生活。我知道的，她只是把我們的煩惱、我們的痛苦，當作閒暇的點綴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，她又怎麼可能真的干擾我們的意志，替我們做出這些選擇呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......檢測到危險物品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這處聖堂，不，整座修道院的地下藏了大量可燃物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一個......可能的選項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們來還是不來，這座修道院中的平靜生活都已經無法延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過饑餓與對流落荒野的恐懼將人逼到什麼地步嗎，費德里科先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在事情發展到無可挽回的地步之前......我會終止這一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒·杜波瓦，你涉嫌破壞安布羅修修道院，並與多起發生於此地的牽涉拉特蘭公民權益的案件有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被確認為拉特蘭公證所的執行目標，根據相關條律規定，我會立刻執行抓捕程序。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科並不會說出多餘的警告。他只會用手中的武器來替代言語。\n克萊芒並未倒下。\n消瘦的男人捂著失去知覺的胳膊，慘笑了一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確認點火器已破壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......不殺死我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼還要費力瞄準點火器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的行為並未直接導致任何拉特蘭公民的死亡。律法並不會宣判你的死刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律法啊......我在這裡生活了這麼多年，聆聽著主教閣下的指引，遵循著你們的律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在平時我總能感受到它的約束......可在混亂中，在我們最需要它的時候，它就會消失不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從某一個時刻開始，我就只能聽到阿爾圖羅小姐的琴聲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科先生，想救我的是拉特蘭的律法......還是你自己？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
